| **OS Longevity** | 7 Years of Updates | 7 Years of Updates | **Draw** |
| **Video Production** | Professional-grade/Codec | Versatile/High-Quality | **iPhone** |

---

### **4. Recommendations**

*   **Choose the iPhone 16 Pro Max if:** You prioritize video production quality, value the "frictionless" synergy of the Apple ecosystem, and prefer a highly refined, consistent OS experience where privacy and long-term resell value are paramount.
*   **Choose the Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra if:** You are a "power user" who requires stylus-based input, extensive screen real estate for multitasking, a display that remains visible in any light, and the flexibility to bridge your mobile device with Windows and non-proprietary hardware.

**Final Verdict:** 
*   **Productivity & Hardware Versatility Winner:** **Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra.** It offers more functional tools out-of-the-box (S-Pen, DeX, advanced display tech) that cater to users who view their phone as a primary work device.
*   **Refinement & Ecosystem Winner:** **iPhone 16 Pro Max.** It remains the gold standard for seamless cross-device communication, high-end video capture, and the stability of the iOS user experience.

